                <pb facs="0906" n="800" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg800"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 5.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Reid to
                        Mr. Giles.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1906-07-09"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">July 9,
                    1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to the resolution by the
                    Federation of Grocers’ Associations of the United Kingdom, and to your letter to
                    myself of 3d of July, I have the honor to transmit herewith a copy of a cable
                    dispatch which I have received from the President of the United States.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Whitelaw Reid.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
